  "claims": [
    "Each admitted descriptor deployment is pinned to a fixed block, EIP-1967 implementation slot, and exact proxy and implementation runtime bytes.",
    "Every implementation runtime matches one exact Sourcify compiler template after only compiler-declared immutable spans are normalized.",
    "EpochRewardsVault deposit and withdraw use the fixed-block ASSET binding; claim transfers FT and derives its amount from accrued reward and available on-chain balance.",
    "MintAndRedeem mint and redeem bind collateral, ftUSD, slippage, and deadline operands; source states that a zero transaction deadline disables expiry.",
    "Production ftUSD is Flying Tulip USD/ftUSD/6 at the exact Ethereum and Sonic fixed blocks; dev raw ftUSD values remain explicitly base units."
  ],
